{"id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-binary-extension-property.md","title":"oracle 的全二值延伸性质","display":"df-binary-extension-property — oracle 的全二值延伸性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-binary-extension-property","aliases":["20-df-binary-extension-property"],"display":"df-binary-extension-property — oracle 的全二值延伸性质","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(iv)","source_printed_pages":[185,186],"source_pdf_pages":[217,218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-binary-extension-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-binary-extension-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-extension-property — oracle 的全二值延伸性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(iv)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>186</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 为普通部分可计算函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary-extension-property}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\\\n[\\operatorname{ran}(\\psi)\\subseteq2\\Rightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq2\\land\\psi\\subseteq f)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary-extension-property}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\\\n[\\operatorname{ran}(\\psi)\\subseteq2\\Rightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq2\\land\\psi\\subseteq f)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>性质量化全部部分二值函数，延伸见证对每个函数可以不同；它不要求一个统一的索引转换器。图包含保留原函数已经定义的输出。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(iv)；印刷页 185, 186；PDF 第 217, 218 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary-extension-property}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\\\n[\\operatorname{ran}(\\psi)\\subseteq2\\Rightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq2\\land\\psi\\subseteq f)].","display":true}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1cda67d4ddf93f2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"e7923f429b681274","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-binary-extension-property]] — 章 10；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-binary-extension-property]]"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e","140cce30ee9c16d1"]}